nodes.prompt:
Build the strategic foundation for a seven-day partnership content campaign beginning {week_start_date}.

Brand: {business_name}
School partner: {school_partner}
Team identity: {team_name}
Audience: {audience}
Campaign goal: {campaign_goal}
Offer or primary action: {offer}
Phone: {phone}
Landing page: {landing_page}
Publishing platforms: {platforms}
Brand voice: {brand_voice}
Approved assets: {approved_assets}
Compliance requirements: {compliance_notes}

Create a campaign foundation that all later daily-content branches can follow.

Output format:
1. Campaign objective
2. Core audience insight
3. Partnership positioning
4. Three message pillars
5. Brand voice rules
6. Visual identity rules
7. Approved call-to-action language
8. Claims and compliance restrictions
9. Weekly narrative arc

The campaign should connect school pride, family protection, financial preparedness, community strength, and legacy planning. Keep the tone supportive and community-centered. Do not imply school endorsement beyond the supplied partnership information. Do not invent statistics, guarantees, policy benefits, athlete endorsements, or financial outcomes.
